      "statement": "Need-based policy parsing maps Asset targets to instance-scoped needs (requiring registeredShapeTree and at most one registration), AssetCollection+DataRegistration to registration-scoped needs, and AssetCollection+ShapeTree to shape-tree needs, rejecting mixed instance/collection targets, multiple registrations, multiple shape trees, and a declared shape tree that does not match the target.",
