      "statement": "The plain LWS target resolver maps Asset targets to instance needs by loading each instance's data registration and shape tree (verifying the optional partOf containment), AssetCollection+DataRegistration to the registration's shape tree, and AssetCollection+ShapeTree to the named shape trees, and rejects container/storage-only targets with 400.",
